'''Aemad's Adventuring Supplies''' is a [[general store]] in [[East Ardougne]]. The store is run by its owner, [[Aemad]], and his assistant, [[Kortan]]. Although it does not sell the default items of a typical general store, it sells several items used in [[quest]]s around RuneScape, notably [[rope]].

Two nearby banks ([[Ardougne north bank]] and [[Ardougne south bank]]) make this general store useful for buying and banking vials of water. The [[Ardougne Market]] is also nearby, making this store handy for selling items stolen from [[Stall|stalls]]. 

This general store is particularly useful to [[Ultimate ironmen|Ultimate Ironmen]]; both an axe and a pickaxe may be quickly obtained after an [[Ardougne Teleport]] teleports the caster to the nearby Ardougne market. Additionally, the quick access to [[Ball of wool|balls of wool]] makes this store helpful to quickly string [[Amulet|amulets]].

