** Because pearls in aerial fishing scales with the player's [[Hunter]] and [[Fishing]] levels, players with 99 in both of these skills would require 87,750 catches on average to purchase everything assuming all Golden tenches are traded in, or 65,250 without purchasing the outfit. This equates to roughly 60 hours of decent efficiency on aerial fishing, or 45 without the outfit.
