The '''Lost Property shop''' is an item retrieval service run by [[Perdu]] and [[Chris]]. Players are able to retrieve certain items that might have been lost for a fee. The fee is generally higher than what would be paid if the player retrieved the item in its traditional manner. The fee can be taken directly from the player's bank if they do not have the required amount in their inventory.

In order for certain eligible items to appear in the Lost Property Shop the player must have none of the item on them, in their bank or in the [[Player-owned house|POH]]. For a full list of which items are excluded from this and can be obtained multiples of, see under [[Lost Property shop#Exceptions|exceptions]].

'''Note: If the player's inventory is full, the item will be dropped directly under the player without warning.'''
[[File:Lost Property shop interface.png|right|thumb|Perdu's Lost Property shop.|300px]]

==Locations==
Perdu can be found in the following locations:
* [[Lumbridge]] - Castle courtyard.
* [[Varrock]] - Grand Exchange.
* [[Catherby]] - In the house just north of the [[bank]].
* [[Edgeville]] - {{FloorNumber|uk=1}} of the general store (inside the bank on [[PvP]] and [[BH]] worlds).
* [[Falador]] - {{FloorNumber|uk=1}} of the general store.
* [[Ferox Enclave]] - by the bank chest.
* [[Emir's Arena]] - [[Chris]] can be found by the bank chest.
* [[Daimon's Crater]] - In the lobby.

