The '''Paramaya Inn''' is an inn in [[Shilo Village (location)|Shilo Village]]. It is run by [[Kaleb Paramaya]], who used to give players a reward for completing the medium [[Karamja Diary]]. [[Pirate Jackie the Fruit]] is now solely responsible for that task.

Players can purchase [[jug of wine|wine]] for one [[coin]] and [[beer]] for two [[coins]]. Also if players want to, they can purchase a [[Paramaya ticket]] for 35 coins and rent a room for the night. On the top floor (the area requiring a Paramaya ticket to enter) are only some beds and cabinets. The Inn was useful during ''[[RuneScape Classic]]'', as beds were necessary for players to rest on to restore their Fatigue; however, as fatigue is not present in [[Old School RuneScape]], this area is useless during normal gameplay.

