'''The Pandemonium''' is a pub made up of ships on the southern end of [[The Pandemonium]] and is run by [['Squawking' Steve Beanie]]. The pub has a rule stating that patrons are not to disrespect their fellow sailors, no matter who they may be. This is why customs officers and pirates can be found peacefully chatting with each other within the area.

There are two [[beer]] spawns on the tables, though only one of them is accessible.

Two [[Whirlpool surprise]]s can be claimed from [[Rum-dashed Ralph]] by choosing the dialog option "Do I have any rewards to claim?" after achieving Shark rank in [[The Tempor Tantrum]]. After claiming for the first time, Steve will sell an unlimited amount for 300 coins each.

